  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0418.mammakythos.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0418.mammakythos.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0418.mammakythos.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos"><head>ΜΑΜΜΑΚΥΘΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="19" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-19" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <p>δουλάρια</p>
              <note type="source">Μεταγένης. Pollux 3, 76.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-1-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐπειδὰν δειπνῶμέν που, τότε πλεῖστα λαλοῦμεν ἅπαντες.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 8, 355a. cf. Metagen. 3.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-2-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὑμῖν ὀρχηστρίδας εἶπον ἑταίρας</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-2-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὡραίας πρότερον· νῦν δ’ οὐχ ὑμῖν ἀγορεύω</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-2-l3" xml:lang="grc">ἄρτι χνοαζούσας αὐλητρίδας, αἵτε τάχιστα</l>
                <l n="4" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-2-l4" xml:lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν φορτηγῶν ὑπὸ γούνατα μισθοῦ ἔλυσαν.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 13, 571b. cf. Metagen. 4.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <p>ἀνθέων</p>
              <p>τὴν γενικὴν ὁμοίως τοῖς Ἴωσιν οἱ Ἀττικοί . . . Ἀρισταγόρας Μαμμακύθῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 404, 28 et Suidas ἀνθέων.</p>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <p>βασιλεύς</p>
              <p>χωρὶς τοῦ ἄρθρου. Ἀρισταγόρας Μαμμακύθῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 85, 25. i. e. rex Persarum.</p>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="kock-0418-mammakythos-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0418_mammakythos">
              <p>ἱμάντας</p>
              <p>τοὺς τῶν ἱστίων. Ἀρισταγόρας. Photius.</p>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
